abstract: >-
  Vietnamese AI Framework provides ViLegal-TemporalRAG, the open
  ViLegal-TempBench v2 benchmark (160 clauses, 38 graph edges, 84 QA across 5 splits
  including colloquial T5), Contract Review Pro (5 Vietnamese contract rulesets with
  citation-verified hybrid LLM support), ViEdge-RustEngine, ViAlign-SafeLoop
  (eval-gated continual alignment with token-level KL and QLoRA orchestration), and a
  bundled 38,372-word MIT Vietnamese lexicon for reproducible local-first AI.
